Package: mdtoolkit
Title: Tools for Working with Markdown Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Matthew C.", "Vanderbilt", , "rdy2dve@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of functions for parsing, validating, converting,
    and generating Markdown files, including building Markdown tables from
    data files such as CSV or Excel. Designed for reuse across teaching
    materials, technical writing, and reporting workflows.
